Fixes #75600\r\n\r\nThe fix was actually very easy. When a line is found in a built-in script, it will be a specific line in the scene file. That line will always be preceded by a script header from the script it's part of. So I just made the editor crawl upwards until the header, which allows to determine the correct script. Previously the scanning was done from the top and it only found the first script or whatever.\r\n\r\nFor some reason, clicking the line if script editor is not visible, will not jump to that line. You have to click again. Not sure how to fix that, as using deferred call does not help. It's not that important though, code search is usually done from within script editor anyway.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111641/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111641/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}